### Register a new user
POST https://localhost:5925/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Jules Auditor",
  "email": "jules@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login
POST https://localhost:5925/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jules@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Access protected endpoint (Will fail without token or if not Admin)
GET https://localhost:5925/api/movies
Accept: application/json
